---
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Stop Babysitting Your Law Firm | Attorney Assistant"
  description="You built a team and grew the business — so why does everything still depend on you? Attorney Assistant brings structure to your firm so things get done without constant oversight."
  noindex={true}
  schema={{
    "@type": "WebPage",
    "name": "Stop Babysitting Your Law Firm",
    "description": "Attorney Assistant brings structure and consistency to your firm's operations so you can stop micromanaging.",
    "publisher": {
      "@type": "Organization",
      "name": "Attorney Assistant"
    }
  }}
>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
       HERO
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-brand-950 min-h-[90vh] flex items-center">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-navy via-brand-900 to-brand-950"></div>
    <div class="lp-orb lp-orb--1" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="lp-orb lp-orb--2" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="lp-orb lp-orb--3" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="grain-overlay"></div>

    <!-- Animated grid lines -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-[1] opacity-[0.03]" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.5) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.5) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 60px 60px;"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="container-wide relative z-10 py-20 lg:py-28">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-start">
        <div class="reveal">
          <div class="mb-5">
            <span class="lp-pulse-badge">
              <span class="lp-pulse-dot"></span>
              For Law Firm Owners
            </span>
          </div>
          <h1 class="text-display-md md:text-display-lg lg:text-display-xl font-heading text-white leading-tight mb-5">
            Stop Babysitting <br/><span class="text-gradient-gold">Your Law Firm.</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-300 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
            You hired adults. Built a team. Grew the business. So why does everything still depend on you checking that it got done?
          </p>

          <!-- Animated stat ticker -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-10">
            <div class="lp-hero-stat">
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-num lp-count" data-target="78">0</span><span class="lp-hero-stat-num">%</span>
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-label">of clients sign with the first firm that responds</span>
            </div>
            <div class="lp-hero-stat">
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-num lp-count" data-target="5">0</span><span class="lp-hero-stat-num">min</span>
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-label">is the window before a lead goes cold</span>
            </div>
            <div class="lp-hero-stat">
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-num lp-count" data-target="40">0</span><span class="lp-hero-stat-num">%</span>
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-label">of calls to law firms go unanswered</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- What you get on the call -->
          <div class="space-y-4 mb-10">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest">On Your Call We'll Cover</p>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-gold/10 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-gold" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21 21l-5.197-5.197m0 0A7.5 7.5 0 105.196 5.196a7.5 7.5 0 0010.607 10.607z" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-base font-semibold text-white">Where leads are slipping through</p>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-0.5">We'll map your intake process and find the gaps.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-gold/10 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-gold" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6v12m-3-2.818l.879.659c1.171.879 3.07.879 4.242 0 1.172-.879 1.172-2.303 0-3.182C13.536 12.219 12.768 12 12 12c-.725 0-1.45-.22-2.003-.659-1.106-.879-1.106-2.303 0-3.182s2.9-.879 4.006 0l.415.33M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-base font-semibold text-white">What it's costing you per month</p>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-0.5">Real numbers, not guesswork.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-gold/10 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-gold" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-base font-semibold text-white">How to fix it without replacing your team</p>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-0.5">Actionable steps you can take this week.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-400">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              Free consultation
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              No commitment
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              We integrate with your team
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Booking Widget -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-1 shadow-2xl ring-1 ring-white/10 reveal lp-widget-glow" style="transition-delay: 150ms" id="book-now">
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4 md:p-5">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
              <div class="featured-icon featured-icon-md featured-icon-gold">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6.75 3v2.25M17.25 3v2.25M3 18.75V7.5a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 7.5v11.25m-18 0A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0021 18.75m-18 0v-7.5A2.25 2.25 0 015.25 9h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 11.25v7.5" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h2 class="text-lg font-heading text-gray-900">Book Your Call</h2>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">Free &mdash; 30 minutes</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="meetings-iframe-container" data-src="https://meet.attorneyassistant.com/meetings/attorney-assistant/professional-meets-absurd?embed=true"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Scroll indicator -->
    <div class="absolute bottom-8 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-10 lp-scroll-hint" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="w-6 h-10 rounded-full border-2 border-white/20 flex justify-center pt-2">
        <div class="w-1 h-2.5 bg-brand-gold rounded-full lp-scroll-dot"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
       OPENING — "A Day in Your Life" timeline
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gray-950 lp-section-lg">
    <div class="absolute inset-0">
      <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-brand-gold/5 rounded-full blur-[120px]"></div>
      <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-red-500/3 rounded-full blur-[100px]"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="grain-overlay"></div>

    <div class="container-wide relative z-10">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center">
        <!-- Left: Story -->
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="badge bg-brand-gold/15 text-brand-gold border-brand-gold/20 mb-6">The Reality</span>
          <h2 class="text-display-sm md:text-display-md font-heading text-white mb-5 leading-tight">
            From the outside, your firm looks solid.
          </h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Cases are coming in. Revenue is moving. The team is busy. Then there's what it <em>actually</em> feels like to run it.
          </p>
          <p class="text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            You don't fully trust that things are handled unless you see it yourself. So you check. You ask. You double-check. And you do it again tomorrow.
          </p>
          <p class="text-xl font-heading text-brand-gold">
            That's not leadership. That's babysitting with better clothes.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: Day calendar view -->
        <div class="reveal" style="transition-delay: 150ms">
          <div class="lp-cal">
            <!-- Calendar header -->
            <div class="lp-cal-header">
              <div class="lp-cal-header-left">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-red-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M5.75 2a.75.75 0 01.75.75V4h7V2.75a.75.75 0 011.5 0V4h.25A2.75 2.75 0 0118 6.75v8.5A2.75 2.75 0 0115.25 18H4.75A2.75 2.75 0 012 15.25v-8.5A2.75 2.75 0 014.75 4H5V2.75A.75.75 0 015.75 2z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
                <span>Today &mdash; A Typical Day</span>
              </div>
              <div class="lp-cal-header-status">
                <span class="lp-cal-status-dot lp-cal-status-dot--red"></span>
                4 issues
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Time slots -->
            <div class="lp-cal-body">
              <div class="lp-cal-slot">
                <div class="lp-cal-time">8:47a</div>
                <div class="lp-cal-event lp-cal-event--red">
                  <div class="lp-cal-event-bar lp-cal-event-bar--red"></div>
                  <div class="lp-cal-event-content">
                    <div class="lp-cal-event-row">
                      <span class="lp-cal-event-title">Missed Call &mdash; New Lead</span>
                      <span class="lp-cal-event-badge lp-cal-event-badge--red">Lost</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="lp-cal-event-desc">Team in a meeting. Call went to voicemail. Lead called the next firm.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="lp-cal-slot">
                <div class="lp-cal-time">11:30a</div>
                <div class="lp-cal-event lp-cal-event--amber">
                  <div class="lp-cal-event-bar lp-cal-event-bar--amber"></div>
                  <div class="lp-cal-event-content">
                    <div class="lp-cal-event-row">
                      <span class="lp-cal-event-title">Follow-Up Check</span>
                      <span class="lp-cal-event-badge lp-cal-event-badge--amber">Delayed</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="lp-cal-event-desc">"I thought Sarah was handling that." Nobody followed up.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="lp-cal-slot">
                <div class="lp-cal-time">3:15p</div>
                <div class="lp-cal-event lp-cal-event--amber">
                  <div class="lp-cal-event-bar lp-cal-event-bar--amber"></div>
                  <div class="lp-cal-event-content">
                    <div class="lp-cal-event-row">
                      <span class="lp-cal-event-title">You Re-Check Intake Notes</span>
                      <span class="lp-cal-event-badge lp-cal-event-badge--amber">Manual</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="lp-cal-event-desc">Double-checking the CRM yourself. Asking for status on things already due.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="lp-cal-slot">
                <div class="lp-cal-time">6:45p</div>
                <div class="lp-cal-event lp-cal-event--red">
                  <div class="lp-cal-event-bar lp-cal-event-bar--red"></div>
                  <div class="lp-cal-event-content">
                    <div class="lp-cal-event-row">
                      <span class="lp-cal-event-title">After-Hours Lead &mdash; No Coverage</span>
                      <span class="lp-cal-event-badge lp-cal-event-badge--red">Lost</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="lp-cal-event-desc">By Monday they signed elsewhere. You'll never even know they called.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Calendar footer -->
            <div class="lp-cal-footer">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-gray-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M16.023 9.348h4.992v-.001M2.985 19.644v-4.992m0 0h4.992m-4.993 0l3.181 3.183a8.25 8.25 0 0013.803-3.7M4.031 9.865a8.25 8.25 0 0113.803-3.7l3.181 3.182" /></svg>
              <span>Repeats tomorrow. And the day after that.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
       THE REAL PROBLEM — animated structure gaps
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-white lp-section-lg">
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-red-500 via-brand-gold to-brand-blue"></div>
    <div class="container-wide">
      <div class="text-center mb-14 reveal">
        <span class="badge bg-brand-navy/10 text-brand-navy border-brand-navy/15 mb-4">The Real Problem</span>
        <h2 class="text-display-sm md:text-display-md font-heading text-gray-900 mb-4">
          Your team isn't the issue.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-500 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          They're working. They're trying. They care. But effort doesn't create consistency. What's missing is <strong class="text-gray-900">structure.</strong>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="text-center mb-6 reveal">
        <p class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-8">No clear system for&hellip;</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 reveal">
        <div class="lp-struct-card lp-struct-card--1">
          <div class="lp-struct-icon">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.75 13.5l10.5-11.25L12 10.5h8.25L9.75 21.75 12 13.5H3.75z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-heading text-gray-900 mt-4 mb-2">Speed to Lead</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">How fast new leads are handled — or if they're handled at all.</p>
          <div class="lp-struct-bar">
            <div class="lp-struct-bar-fill lp-struct-bar-fill--red" style="width: 25%"></div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-red-500 font-medium mt-2">Critical gap</p>
        </div>

        <div class="lp-struct-card lp-struct-card--2">
          <div class="lp-struct-icon lp-struct-icon--amber">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 12c0-1.232-.046-2.453-.138-3.662a4.006 4.006 0 00-3.7-3.7 48.678 48.678 0 00-7.324 0 4.006 4.006 0 00-3.7 3.7c-.017.22-.032.441-.046.662M19.5 12l3-3m-3 3l-3-3m-12 3c0 1.232.046 2.453.138 3.662a4.006 4.006 0 003.7 3.7 48.656 48.656 0 007.324 0 4.006 4.006 0 003.7-3.7c.017-.22.032-.441.046-.662M4.5 12l3 3m-3-3l-3 3" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-heading text-gray-900 mt-4 mb-2">Follow-Up Cadence</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">How often follow-up happens — or stops after one try.</p>
          <div class="lp-struct-bar">
            <div class="lp-struct-bar-fill lp-struct-bar-fill--amber" style="width: 40%"></div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-amber-600 font-medium mt-2">Inconsistent</p>
        </div>

        <div class="lp-struct-card lp-struct-card--3">
          <div class="lp-struct-icon lp-struct-icon--red">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21.752 15.002A9.718 9.718 0 0118 15.75c-5.385 0-9.75-4.365-9.75-9.75 0-1.33.266-2.597.748-3.752A9.753 9.753 0 003 11.25C3 16.635 7.365 21 12.75 21a9.753 9.753 0 009.002-5.998z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-heading text-gray-900 mt-4 mb-2">After-Hours Coverage</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">What happens when your team is off the clock.</p>
          <div class="lp-struct-bar">
            <div class="lp-struct-bar-fill lp-struct-bar-fill--red" style="width: 15%"></div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-red-500 font-medium mt-2">Major exposure</p>
        </div>

        <div class="lp-struct-card lp-struct-card--4">
          <div class="lp-struct-icon lp-struct-icon--amber">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.75 6a3.75 3.75 0 11-7.5 0 3.75 3.75 0 017.5 0zM4.501 20.118a7.5 7.5 0 0114.998 0A17.933 17.933 0 0112 21.75c-2.676 0-5.216-.584-7.499-1.632z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-heading text-gray-900 mt-4 mb-2">Ownership & Accountability</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Who owns what, and when — or nobody does.</p>
          <div class="lp-struct-bar">
            <div class="lp-struct-bar-fill lp-struct-bar-fill--amber" style="width: 35%"></div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-amber-600 font-medium mt-2">Unclear</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="text-center text-gray-500 mt-10 max-w-xl mx-auto reveal">
        Things slip. Not dramatically. Just enough to cost you cases. And just often enough that you feel like you have to stay on top of <em>everything.</em>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
       THE COST — dramatic full-width dark section
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gray-950 lp-section-lg">
    <div class="absolute inset-0">
      <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[800px] h-[800px] bg-red-500/5 rounded-full blur-[120px]"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="grain-overlay"></div>

    <div class="container-wide relative z-10">
      <div class="text-center mb-14 reveal">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-red-500/10 text-red-400 border border-red-500/20 mb-6">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-400 animate-pulse"></span>
          Silent Revenue Leak
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-display-sm md:text-display-md font-heading text-white mb-4">
          It's happening quietly.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 max-w-xl mx-auto">No alerts. No big warning. Just lost opportunities you never even see.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 lg:gap-8 reveal">
        <div class="lp-cost-card">
          <div class="lp-cost-card-icon lp-cost-card-icon--red">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 6.75c0 8.284 6.716 15 15 15h2.25a2.25 2.25 0 002.25-2.25v-1.372c0-.516-.351-.966-.852-1.091l-4.423-1.106c-.44-.11-.902.055-1.173.417l-.97 1.293c-.282.376-.769.542-1.21.38a12.035 12.035 0 01-7.143-7.143c-.162-.441.004-.928.38-1.21l1.293-.97c.363-.271.527-.734.417-1.173L6.963 3.102a1.125 1.125 0 00-1.091-.852H4.5A2.25 2.25 0 002.25 4.5v2.25z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-heading text-white mt-5 mb-2">Every missed call</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">is a potential client who hired someone else. They called once. You didn't answer. They moved on.</p>
          <div class="lp-cost-card-line lp-cost-card-line--red"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="lp-cost-card">
          <div class="lp-cost-card-icon lp-cost-card-icon--amber">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6v6h4.5m4.5 0a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-heading text-white mt-5 mb-2">Every slow follow-up</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">is a lead that went cold. They were interested. Now they're someone else's signed client.</p>
          <div class="lp-cost-card-line lp-cost-card-line--amber"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="lp-cost-card">
          <div class="lp-cost-card-icon lp-cost-card-icon--navy">
